  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE_README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.10.0-alpha.14: Add a one-command GitHub-assisted today-to-date author portfolio with local-workspace mapping, relevant open-PR discovery, narrow immutable-object acquisition, inline daily capacity, and concise Markdown or versioned JSON output. Complete zero-work days and incomplete discovery remain explicit and privacy-safe. Narrow Change scopes now retain Java/Kotlin fallback ownership, while immutable .NET project-context reuse reduces repeated portfolio analysis under exact identity guards. Repository EHE remains experimental and uncalibrated, and seed-rules/0.4.0 remains the shipped estimator. Full notes: https://github.com/VictorZakharov/efforthours/blob/v0.10.0-alpha.14/CHANGELOG.md",
